     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all, <div><br></div><div>Can shiny output ggplots as svg easily, rather than png? </div><div>I&#39;m using the interactive ggplot features, so <a href=\"https://github.com/timelyportfolio/svgPanZoom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/timelyportfolio/svgPanZoom&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792397498495000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2PRFnDNpj6Dl-ouNPyP6Bl\">svgPanZoom</a> doesnt help (but is cool, and could also be useful). </div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
